{
  "file" : "npc/cities/yuno.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]",
      "translation" : "[弗雷德里希]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^3355FFJuno^000000 is kept aloft in the air by an ancient and mysterious force.",
      "translation" : "^3355FF朱諾^000000依靠一種古老而神秘的力量漂浮在空中。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]",
      "translation" : "[弗雷德里希]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This power is said to come from a relic from an ancient civilization called ^3355FFJuperos^000000 which existed here long before Juno.",
      "translation" : "據說，這股力量來自名為^3355FF朱佩羅斯^000000的古代文明遺物。朱佩羅斯早在朱諾出現以前就存在於此。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]",
      "translation" : "[弗雷德里希]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Research revealed that Juno's power source based on ^3355FFPieces of Ymir's Heart^000000. I hear that this power source is found where Juperos used to exist.",
      "translation" : "研究發現，朱諾的能量來源是^3355FF尤彌爾之心碎片^000000。我聽說這種能量源就在朱佩羅斯遺址。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]",
      "translation" : "[弗雷德里希]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Since many scholars have been coming to Juno to study and research this power source, our city is basically a well known mecca for scholars.",
      "translation" : "許多學者來到朱諾研究這種能量源，因此我們的城市如今已成為知名的學術聖地。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]",
      "translation" : "[弗雷德里希]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The city of Sages,",
      "translation" : "賢者之城"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^3355FFJuno,^000000 is made of",
      "translation" : "^3355FF朱諾^000000由"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "three islands.",
      "translation" : "三座島嶼組成。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]",
      "translation" : "[弗雷德里希]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "These are Solomon, the island of honor, Mineta, the island of prosperity, and Snotora, the island of knowledge.",
      "translation" : "分別是榮譽之島所羅門、繁榮之島米涅塔，以及知識之島斯諾托拉。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]",
      "translation" : "[弗雷德里希]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The location of each island is",
      "translation" : "各島的位置如下："
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "North-west : Solomon",
      "translation" : "西北：所羅門"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "North-east : Snotora",
      "translation" : "東北：斯諾托拉"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "South : Mineta.",
      "translation" : "南方：米涅塔。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So, do you enjoy candy?",
      "translation" : "那麼，你喜歡糖果嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^3355FFGranny hands you some candy^000000.",
      "translation" : "^3355FF老奶奶遞給你一些糖果^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've already chosen. It doesn't matter whether or not you get this candy. That doesn't matter at all. You have to understand why it's happened.",
      "translation" : "你已經做出選擇了。拿不拿這些糖果都無所謂。真正重要的是，你必須明白事情為何會變成這樣。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Here's ^3355FF1,000 zeny^000000.",
      "translation" : "給你^3355FF1,000 ZENY^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you accept this?",
      "translation" : "你要收下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Accept",
      "translation" : "收下"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do not accept",
      "translation" : "不收下"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Giggle*",
      "translation" : "*咯咯*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There you go~",
      "translation" : "給你~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Giggle*",
      "translation" : "*咯咯*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well then...",
      "translation" : "那麼..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "See you ~",
      "translation" : "再見啦~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, that's right. Now you must ask yourself why you didn't accept the candy I offered.",
      "translation" : "沒錯。現在你該問問自己，為什麼沒有收下我給你的糖果。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Giggle giggle*",
      "translation" : "*咯咯咯*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The time has come.",
      "translation" : "時候到了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well then...",
      "translation" : "那麼..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am an old Sage granny who foresees everything...",
      "translation" : "我是能預知一切的賢者老奶奶..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have you heard of a boss monster that has been around Juno for a long time? It's known only as the ^FF3355Lord of the Dead^000000.",
      "translation" : "你聽說過長期徘徊在朱諾附近的首領魔物嗎？人們只稱它為^FF3355死亡之王^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It is rumored to be from the realm of the dead. It brings many undead monsters with it, intending to lead living creatures to its cold and icy realm.",
      "translation" : "據說它來自冥界，會帶來許多不死魔物，企圖把生靈引入冰冷的國度。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Granny]",
      "translation" : "[老奶奶]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You have already chosen whether or not you will challenge the Lord of the Dead. All you need to do right now is understand why you made the decision.",
      "translation" : "你已經決定是否挑戰死亡之王。現在只需要明白自己為何做出這個決定。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergiof]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧夫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My name is Sergiof,",
      "translation" : "我叫塞爾吉奧夫，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "the fighter who",
      "translation" : "是侍奉老奶奶的"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "serves Granny.",
      "translation" : "戰士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergiof]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧夫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I will tell you about ^3355FFGrand Peco^000000 which is a high level Peco Peco. Grand Peco is faster than Peco Peco and is quite aggressive.",
      "translation" : "我來告訴你^3355FF大嘴鳥波利^000000的事。它是高等級的大嘴鳥，比普通大嘴鳥跑得更快，也更具攻擊性。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergiof]",
      "translation" : "[塞爾吉奧夫]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It attacks using its strong bill and many Peco Pecos follow it. There's quite a difference in power between Peco Peco and the Grand Peco.",
      "translation" : "它會用強有力的鳥喙攻擊，而且身邊常有許多大嘴鳥跟隨。普通大嘴鳥和大嘴鳥波利的實力相差很大。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Ninno]",
      "translation" : "[尼諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are very lucky to have me tell you this story. This only happens by ^FF33551 out of a 1,000 chance^000000.",
      "translation" : "能聽我講這個故事，你真是走運。這種事發生的機率只有^FF3355千分之一^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Ninno]",
      "translation" : "[尼諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This world you are experiencing is actually fabricated! It's time for you to see reality for what it is!",
      "translation" : "你所經歷的世界其實是虛構的！是時候看清現實了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Ninno]",
      "translation" : "[尼諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Open your eyes! Stop being manipulated by virtual reality!",
      "translation" : "睜開眼睛！別再受虛擬現實擺佈了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have you ever heard of an Egyptian king who was once believed to be a son of a god? His name is ^3355FFPharoah^000000.",
      "translation" : "你聽說過那位曾被認為是神之子的埃及國王嗎？他名叫^3355FF法老王^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Ninno]",
      "translation" : "[尼諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He was rumored to be a high sorcerer that used his power to curse innocents. It is said that he is still around, placing his curses on people.",
      "translation" : "據說他是強大的魔法師，曾用力量詛咒無辜之人。傳聞他至今仍四處遊蕩，詛咒他人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Ninno]",
      "translation" : "[尼諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As an adventurer, it's possible that you may see him in your travels. Be careful...",
      "translation" : "冒險途中你可能會遇見他。千萬小心..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]",
      "translation" : "[勒·莫菲斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Look in my hand. I am holding two different kinds of herbs.",
      "translation" : "看看我手裡。我拿著兩種不同的草藥。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]",
      "translation" : "[勒·莫菲斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "One is a ^3355FFBlue Herb^000000 which will make you forget about reality and keep you in this virtual reality^000000.",
      "translation" : "一種是^3355FF藍色藥草^000000，能讓你忘記現實，繼續留在這個虛擬世界^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]",
      "translation" : "[勒·莫菲斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The other is a ^FF3355Red Herb^000000 which will reveal to you what is true and real.",
      "translation" : "另一種是^FF3355紅色藥草^000000，能讓你看清真相。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]",
      "translation" : "[勒·莫菲斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Whichever one you choose, you must spend ^3355FF5,000 zeny^000000. Now, please select one.",
      "translation" : "無論選哪一種，都要花費^3355FF5,000 ZENY^000000。現在請選擇。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Choose ^FF3355Red Herb^000000",
      "translation" : "選擇^FF3355紅色藥草^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Choose ^3355FFBlue Herb^000000.",
      "translation" : "選擇^3355FF藍色藥草^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]",
      "translation" : "[勒·莫菲斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "As you have chosen, you will forget everything, and remain in this virtual reality.",
      "translation" : "既然你已經做出選擇，就會忘記一切，繼續留在這個虛擬世界。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]",
      "translation" : "[勒·莫菲斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You will see the truth.",
      "translation" : "你會看見真相。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm. I'm sorry to say you just missed a fortunate chance. However, I can tell you don't have enough wealth to bring this fortune to fruition.",
      "translation" : "嗯。很遺憾，你剛剛錯過了一次好運。不過，我看得出你沒有足夠的錢財來實現這份好運。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^3355FFApocalypse^000000...",
      "translation" : "^3355FF天使波利^000000..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It is the name of an android that used to guard Juno long ago.",
      "translation" : "這是很久以前守衛朱諾的一臺機器人之名。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]",
      "translation" : "[勒·莫菲斯]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Because its artificial intelligence has corrupted over the years, it can no longer distinguish comrades from enemies. Sadly, that android is nothing but a mindless monster now.",
      "translation" : "它的人工智慧隨著歲月流逝而損壞，已經無法分辨敵我。可悲的是，那臺機器人如今只是一頭失去理智的魔物。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Mumble mumble...*",
      "translation" : "*嘟囔嘟囔...*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh, hello there. Let me introduce myself. I am an artisan who tries to succeed the rights and duties of item makers in Juno.",
      "translation" : "哦，你好。讓我自我介紹一下。我是一名工匠，想繼承朱諾道具製作師的權利與職責。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "About Powerful Equipment",
      "translation" : "關於強力裝備"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "About Unique Items",
      "translation" : "關於稀有道具"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "About Authentic Food",
      "translation" : "關於正宗料理"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Let me suggest the ^3355FFHoly Guard^000000 and ^3355FFHoly Avenger^000000 which are special items for Crusaders.",
      "translation" : "我推薦^3355FF聖職之盾^000000和^3355FF聖者之劍^000000，它們是十字軍專用的特殊裝備。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "These pieces of equipment are very light and have sufficient abilities. They also happen to possess holy power.",
      "translation" : "這些裝備非常輕巧，效能也很出色，而且還擁有聖屬性力量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Therefore, this equipment is more powerful over some kinds of monsters such as Ghosts or the Undead.",
      "translation" : "因此，它們對幽靈或不死系等某些魔物尤其有效。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "However it is rumored that only a few chosen Crusaders are able to obtain those items due of their rarity.",
      "translation" : "不過據說這些裝備十分稀有，只有少數被選中的十字軍才能獲得。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It looks like a simple scroll marked with concentric circles and a star. Although the ^FF3355Worn-Out Magic Scroll^000000 is very old, it's wanted by many Sages for research purposes.",
      "translation" : "這看起來是一張畫著同心圓和星星的簡易卷軸。雖然^FF3355陳舊的魔法卷軸^000000年代久遠，卻有許多賢者想用它來研究。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It seems you can use that item when you chant a high-level magic spell.",
      "translation" : "似乎可以在詠唱高階魔法時使用這個道具。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^3355FFRice Cake^000000! Yes, it's a traditional food that's favored by a lot of people. There's a lot of nostalgic memories of old fashioned markets that are connected to the Rice Cake.",
      "translation" : "^3355FF年糕^000000！沒錯，這是一種深受許多人喜愛的傳統食物。年糕總讓人想起舊時市場的許多懷舊回憶。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ahhh~",
      "translation" : "啊~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I wish I could eat a bit of Rice Cake right now.",
      "translation" : "真想現在就吃點年糕。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Artisan]",
      "translation" : "[工匠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Although Juno is known as a city of Sages, I hope you understand that ordinary people live and prosper here as well. Please enjoy the unique atmosphere that Juno has to offer.",
      "translation" : "雖然朱諾以賢者之城聞名，也希望你明白，普通人同樣在這裡生活、繁榮。請盡情感受朱諾獨特的氛圍。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到高尚之城朱諾。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a monster near here known as Lava Golem. This golem is made from a stone heart whose power happened to be amplified with magic power when it was swept away by molten rock.",
      "translation" : "附近有一種叫熔岩魔人的魔物。它由石頭構成，石心被熔岩捲走時，魔力恰好增強，最終變成了這種魔物。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The lava dripping from its body is so hot that it can melt down armor and weapons made out of high quality steel.",
      "translation" : "它身上滴落的熔岩極其熾熱，能融化用上等鋼材打造的防具和武器。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You'd better be careful when you encounter this monster. It will damage armor and weapons in the twinkling of an eye.",
      "translation" : "遇到這種魔物時最好小心。轉眼之間，它就能損壞你的防具和武器。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到高尚之城朱諾。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Geographer...",
      "translation" : "地理學者..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That monster looks like a flower blooming from the ground.",
      "translation" : "那種魔物看起來像是從地面長出來的花。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Strangely, it can extend its body a long distance. Even if you're far away from it, it can still pose a threat.",
      "translation" : "奇怪的是，它能把身體伸得很遠。即使你離它很遠，仍然會受到威脅。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The name of this monster originated from a story about a poor geographer who, unfortunately, was eaten by this monster while he was immersed in his studies.",
      "translation" : "這種魔物的名字源自一個故事：一位可憐的地理學者專心研究時，不幸被它吞掉了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到高尚之城朱諾。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 280,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Near Juno, there exists a fallen angel named 'False Angel.' It feigns innocence, pretending to bless adventurers and then stabbing them in the back without any warning.",
      "translation" : "朱諾附近有一種墮落天使，名叫“偽天使”。它裝出純潔的樣子，假意祝福冒險者，再毫無預警地從背後襲擊。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 282,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't be fooled by its appearance, or you'll find yourself in trouble.",
      "translation" : "別被它的外表騙了，否則你會惹上麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 289,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到高尚之城朱諾。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 292,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "'Goat' is a monster that was an antelope living in the high mountains that was somehow turned into a monster.",
      "translation" : "“山羊”是一種魔物。它原本是生活在高山上的羚羊，不知為何變成了魔物。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Even if you manage to dodge to its horns, you still need to be wary of its powerful legs.",
      "translation" : "就算你設法躲開它的角，也要提防它強勁的雙腿。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Goat's legs are so strong because it's always climbing cliffs when it's not busy slaughtering the innocent.",
      "translation" : "山羊的腿如此有力，是因為它不忙著屠殺無辜者時，總在攀爬峭壁。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到高尚之城朱諾。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have you ever",
      "translation" : "你見過"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "seen a Large Jellopy?",
      "translation" : "大型傑洛米嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Those things are huuuge!",
      "translation" : "那東西可大——得驚人！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's hard to believe",
      "translation" : "真難以置信，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "that such a large and",
      "translation" : "竟然有這麼大、"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "shining jellopy even exists!",
      "translation" : "還閃閃發亮的傑洛米！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到高尚之城朱諾。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Among the Sage's weapons, there is a 'Dagger of Counter.'",
      "translation" : "賢者使用的武器中，有一種叫“反擊短劍”。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Its use is limited to the Sage class, and it increases the chance of inflicting critical attacks. So, for Sages, that dagger can be very useful, as well as make them look stylish in battle.",
      "translation" : "它只限賢者使用，並能提高造成暴擊的機率。因此，這把短劍對賢者來說既實用，在戰鬥中也很時髦。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness.",
      "translation" : "歡迎來到高尚之城朱諾。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a holy shield named 'Sacred Mission' which can only be used by Crusaders.",
      "translation" : "有一面名為“神聖使命”的聖盾，只有十字軍能夠使用。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 337,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]",
      "translation" : "[朱諾士兵]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's a long and narrow shield with an angel wing engraved in the center of the front side. Against Devil and Undead monsters, it is especially powerful.",
      "translation" : "這是一面狹長的盾牌，正面中央刻有天使之翼。它對惡魔系和不死系魔物尤其有效。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Airship Representative]",
      "translation" : "[飛艇服務員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good day, I am here to inform you",
      "translation" : "您好，我來向您介紹"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
